      "front": "Numerical modeling (spreadsheet): Euler step?",
      "back": "$v_{n+1}=v_n+a_n\\,\\Delta t$,\n$s_{n+1}=s_n+v_n\\,\\Delta t$\n\nwith time step $\\Delta t$,\n$a_n=a(t_n, s_n, v_n)$,\n$t_{n+1}=t_n+\\Delta t$.",
      "category": "E-Phase Mechanics",
      "tags": [
        "GK",
        "LK",
        "coverage:auto",
        "goal:ac25ffe3-fd42-592d-a937-79cc13460313"
      ]
