      "front": "Consequence of the 1st Newton axiom for sum of forces = 0?",
      "back": "$\\sum \\vec F=0 \\Rightarrow \\vec a=0$\n\nthe velocity vector remains constant",
      "category": "E-Phase Mechanics",
      "tags": [
