    },
    {
      "id": "physics_e_cov_015",
      "front": "2nd Newtonian axiom\n(general and for constant mass)?",
      "back": "$\\vec F=\\frac{d \\vec p}{dt}$\n\nfor constant mass:\n\n$\\vec F=m \\vec a$",
